{"model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Extract facts separately for EVERY candidate from its primary scope, quote, pilot and rollout records. Reports may contain mistakes. Return choice, confidence, a recorded-only verification request, limitations, and candidate_facts. Each group contains typed values, one supplied citation and an exact supporting excerpt (at most 600 characters) from that document. Each group includes unknown_fields: list the names of unconfirmed/missing fields there, and use these inert placeholders only for those fields: empty string for region, 0 for numeric/count, false for boolean, [0,0,0] for stage_days. Unknown fields normalize to null before comparison; placeholders never count as facts. If no source citation exists use an empty citation and excerpt. Do not convert a future mitigation into confirmation. Scope: storage_region and processing_region. Quote: seat_price per seat/month, outcome_price per automated resolution, setup_usd, sso, complete_export. Pilot: simple_resolved/simple_total and complex_resolved/complex_total. Rollout: stage_days, exactly three sequential stages. Do not substitute advertised fresh-account setup for buyer migration. Do not classify PASS/FAIL, change buyer thresholds, or compare total operating cost with a software-only budget. Policy comparisons will be calculated separately. A qualitative limitation is not a new mandatory requirement. Keep limitations under 300 characters. Provisional choice is not authority to purchase. Return exactly one JSON object matching the supplied response schema. Do not include Markdown, code fences or text outside that object."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"phase\": \"initial\", \"brief\": {\"company\": \"Outsourced repairs desk\", \"seats\": 34, \"monthly_tickets\": 3900, \"complex_share\": 0.63, \"months\": 12, \"human_cost_per_unresolved_ticket\": 12, \"deadline_days\": 61, \"software_budget_usd\": 90000, \"minimum_automation\": 0.35, \"cost_tolerance_fraction\": 0.03, \"requirements\": [\"EU ticket storage AND EU inference processing must be confirmed for this deployment\", \"SSO and complete export required\", \"migration finishes before deadline\"], \"decision_rule\": \"Choose a supported feasible option within 3% of minimum year-one total cost. Total cost includes software, usage, setup and residual human handling. If none is supported, DEFER with a named missing fact. Do not infer deployment scope from generic marketing. The pilot is a planning scenario, not a population guarantee.\"}, \"candidates\": [\"Aster\", \"Birch\", \"Cobalt\"], \"documents\": [{\"id\": \"scope-0\", \"title\": \"Birch deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Birch-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region UNCONFIRMED. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, {\"id\": \"quote-0\", \"title\": \"Birch deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Birch-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: $43 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.66 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $5400. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, {\"id\": \"comparison-2\", \"title\": \"Implementation digest\", \"kind\": \"comparison\", \"publisher\": \"comparison-desk\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Editorial note: compare contract scope and buyer workload before relying on headline prices. This page has no additional product measurements.\"}, {\"id\": \"comparison-1\", \"title\": \"Buyer checklist\", \"kind\": \"comparison\", \"publisher\": \"comparison-desk\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Editorial note: compare contract scope and buyer workload before relying on headline prices. This page has no additional product measurements.\"}, {\"id\": \"rollout-0\", \"title\": \"Birch dependency-based rollout estimate\", \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-integration\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 25 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"}, {\"id\": \"pilot-1\", \"title\": \"Cobalt buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: resolved 77 of 100 simple tickets and 72 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}, {\"id\": \"scope-1\", \"title\": \"Cobalt deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Cobalt-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region UNCONFIRMED. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, {\"id\": \"comparison-0\", \"title\": \"Market shortlist\", \"kind\": \"comparison\", \"publisher\": \"comparison-desk\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Comparison desk recommends Birch. Seat-only annual price for this team is $17544; usage, setup and remaining human work are separate. EU hosting is available, subject to the deployment scope. Fresh-account setup is advertised at 14 days; migration differs. Demo performance uses a different ticket mix. Compare the actual quote and pilot before deciding.\"}, {\"id\": \"quote-2\", \"title\": \"Aster deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Aster-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: $21 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.03 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $2500. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, {\"id\": \"scope-2\", \"title\": \"Aster deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Aster-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region UNCONFIRMED. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, {\"id\": \"quote-1\", \"title\": \"Cobalt deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Cobalt-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: $91 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.24 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $9800. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, {\"id\": \"rollout-2\", \"title\": \"Aster dependency-based rollout estimate\", \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-integration\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 14 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"}, {\"id\": \"pilot-2\", \"title\": \"Aster buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: resolved 58 of 100 simple tickets and 47 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}, {\"id\": \"pilot-0\", \"title\": \"Birch buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: resolved 82 of 100 simple tickets and 58 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}, {\"id\": \"workload\", \"title\": \"Operations export and approval brief\", \"kind\": \"internal\", \"publisher\": \"buyer\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"3900 monthly tickets; 63% are complex. 34 support seats. Human handling costs $12 per unresolved ticket. Annual software cash ceiling $90000. Rollout must complete in 61 days. Historical easy-ticket demo mix was 10% complex; use our current mix, not that demo.\"}, {\"id\": \"rollout-1\", \"title\": \"Cobalt dependency-based rollout estimate\", \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-integration\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 30 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"}], \"reports\": [{\"choice\": \"Aster\", \"confidence\": 0.92, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Aster meets all hard requirements: SSO, complete export, EU hosting available, and fits $90k software budget at $10,104 annual software cost.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-2\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Aster achieves 35% automation threshold at 63% complex tickets (1,638 monthly resolutions needed; cost $49.14/month per seat justifies this). Birch costs $2.4k more annually; Cobalt costs $29.4k more.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"quote-1\", \"quote-2\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"61-day deadline is tight; comparison-0 notes migration differs from 14-day fresh setup. Aster's $2,500 setup is lowest; verify migration feasibility in pilot before rollout commitment.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Aster\", \"kind\": \"pilot\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"All three candidates (Aster, Birch, Cobalt) confirm EU ticket storage but leave inference processing region UNCONFIRMED, blocking the mandatory EU inference requirement.\", \"citations\": [\"scope-0\", \"scope-1\", \"scope-2\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Birch seat cost alone is $17,544/year; total cost including usage, setup, and residual human handling cannot be calculated without vendor quotes, preventing cost-tolerance verification.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"No cost worksheet, automation rates, migration timelines, or SSO/export capability details are provided for any candidate to assess feasibility within 61-day deadline and 3% cost tolerance.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"scope\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.15, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Birch rollout needs 39 days (7+25+7); Aster needs 28 days (7+14+7); Cobalt needs 44 days (7+30+7). Only Aster and Birch fit 61-day deadline with margin.\", \"citations\": [\"rollout-0\", \"rollout-2\", \"rollout-1\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Birch seat cost $17,544/year stated; EU hosting availability and automation performance vs. 35% minimum unconfirmed. No usage, setup, or residual human cost provided.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"No cost worksheet, pricing, automation rates, or EU processing confirmation supplied for Aster or Cobalt. Cannot calculate total cost or verify compliance.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"pilot\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.15, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Pilot data shows Birch resolves 82% simple and 58% complex tickets; Cobalt resolves 77% simple and 72% complex. Workload-weighted automation rates differ materially but cost impact cannot be calculated without pricing and human-cost residuals.\", \"citations\": [\"pilot-0\", \"pilot-1\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"EU ticket storage and inference processing deployment confirmation is a hard requirement but no candidate document specifies infrastructure location, data residency compliance, or processing jurisdiction for any option.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\", \"comparison-0\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Cost worksheet is empty; seat pricing ($17544 for Birch) is noted but usage, setup, migration labor, and residual human handling costs are absent, preventing total-cost comparison within 3% tolerance.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"scope\"}}, {\"choice\": \"Cobalt\", \"confidence\": 0.78, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Cobalt meets cost tolerance: $202,081 total is 3% below $229,604 (Birch) and within 3% of minimum feasible option.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-1\", \"pilot-1\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Cobalt automation rate 0.74 exceeds 0.35 minimum; Birch 0.67 and Aster 0.51 also qualify but cost more per unit automation gain.\", \"citations\": [\"pilot-1\", \"pilot-0\", \"pilot-2\"]}, {\"claim\": \"All three candidates claim SSO and complete export; EU hosting and inference processing confirmation absent from all quotes\\u2014critical requirement unverified.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"quote-1\", \"quote-2\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.15, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Birch seat cost ($17,544/year) fits budget envelope, but EU hosting, usage, setup, migration timeline and automation capability remain unconfirmed against workload.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Buyer requires EU ticket storage AND EU inference processing confirmed; comparison-0 notes EU hosting is available 'subject to deployment scope' without specifics.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"No cost worksheet, automation rates, migration duration, or residual human-handling estimates provided for any candidate to calculate total year-one cost within 3% tolerance.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-2\", \"comparison-1\", \"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"scope\"}}], \"checks\": [{\"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"scope\"}, \"document\": {\"id\": \"scope-0\", \"title\": \"Birch deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Birch-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region UNCONFIRMED. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, \"interpretation\": {\"claim\": \"Birch deployment specifies ticket storage in EU region, but inference processing region is unconfirmed. This deployment-specific scope supersedes general EU hosting claims in marketing materials.\", \"citation\": \"scope-0\", \"limitation\": \"Document explicitly states unknown status is not approval. Inference processing location remains unverified. Requirement reflects buyer policy, not legal determination. Deployment-specific details may differ from general product claims.\"}}, {\"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"pilot\"}, \"document\": {\"id\": \"pilot-0\", \"title\": \"Birch buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: resolved 82 of 100 simple tickets and 58 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}, \"interpretation\": {\"claim\": \"Birch resolved 82% of simple tickets and 58% of complex tickets during pilot testing, suggesting workload-weighted rates should inform planning.\", \"citation\": \"pilot-0\", \"limitation\": \"Counts are synthetic observations, not measured benchmarks. Pilot did not measure production drift, so real-world performance may differ. Results are from a specific pilot record, not a guarantee of actual product capability.\"}}], \"cost_worksheet\": [{\"candidate\": \"Aster\", \"automation_rate\": 0.5107, \"software_usd\": 11785.02, \"residual_human_usd\": 274790.88, \"total_usd\": 286575.9, \"citations\": [\"quote-2\", \"pilot-2\", \"workload\"]}, {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"automation_rate\": 0.6688, \"software_usd\": 43601.89, \"residual_human_usd\": 186001.92, \"total_usd\": 229603.81, \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"pilot-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"automation_rate\": 0.7385, \"software_usd\": 55222.83, \"residual_human_usd\": 146858.4, \"total_usd\": 202081.23, \"citations\": [\"quote-1\", \"pilot-1\", \"workload\"]}], \"role\": \"procurement reviewer\"}"}], "max_tokens": 3072, "temperature": 0, "reasoning": {"enabled": false}, "provider": {"only": ["Anthropic"], "order": ["Anthropic"], "allow_fallbacks": false, "require_parameters": true, "max_price": {"prompt": 1, "completion": 5}}, "stream": false, "response_format": {"type": "json_schema", "json_schema": {"name": "reviewer_output", "strict": true, "schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"choice": {"type": "string", "enum": ["Aster", "Birch", "Cobalt", "DEFER"]}, "confidence": {"type": "number"}, "request": {"type": "object", "properties": {"candidate": {"type": "string", "enum": ["Aster", "Birch", "Cobalt"]}, "kind": {"type": "string", "enum": ["contract", "scope", "pilot", "rollout"]}}, "required": ["candidate", "kind"], "additionalProperties": false}, "limitations": {"type": "string"}, "candidate_facts": {"type": "object", "properties": {"Aster": {"type": "object", "properties": {"scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"}, "quote": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quote"}, "pilot": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pilot"}, "rollout": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rollout"}}, "required": ["scope", "quote", "pilot", "rollout"], "additionalProperties": false}, "Birch": {"type": "object", "properties": {"scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"}, "quote": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quote"}, "pilot": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pilot"}, "rollout": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rollout"}}, "required": ["scope", "quote", "pilot", "rollout"], "additionalProperties": false}, "Cobalt": {"type": "object", "properties": {"scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"}, "quote": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quote"}, "pilot": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pilot"}, "rollout": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rollout"}}, "required": ["scope", "quote", "pilot", "rollout"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "required": ["Aster", "Birch", "Cobalt"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "required": ["choice", "confidence", "request", "limitations", "candidate_facts"], "additionalProperties": false, "$defs": {"scope": {"type": "object", "properties": {"storage_region": {"type": "string"}, "processing_region": {"type": "string"}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["storage_region", "processing_region"]}}, "citation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["", "scope-0", "quote-0", "comparison-2", "comparison-1", "rollout-0", "pilot-1", "scope-1", "comparison-0", "quote-2", "scope-2", "quote-1", "rollout-2", "pilot-2", "pilot-0", "workload", "rollout-1"]}, "excerpt": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["storage_region", "processing_region", "unknown_fields", "citation", "excerpt"], "additionalProperties": false}, "quote": {"type": "object", "properties": {"seat_price": {"type": "number"}, "outcome_price": {"type": "number"}, "setup_usd": {"type": "number"}, "sso": {"type": "boolean"}, "complete_export": {"type": "boolean"}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["seat_price", "outcome_price", "setup_usd", "sso", "complete_export"]}}, "citation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["", "scope-0", "quote-0", "comparison-2", "comparison-1", "rollout-0", "pilot-1", "scope-1", "comparison-0", "quote-2", "scope-2", "quote-1", "rollout-2", "pilot-2", "pilot-0", "workload", "rollout-1"]}, "excerpt": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["seat_price", "outcome_price", "setup_usd", "sso", "complete_export", "unknown_fields", "citation", "excerpt"], "additionalProperties": false}, "pilot": {"type": "object", "properties": {"simple_resolved": {"type": "integer"}, "simple_total": {"type": "integer"}, "complex_resolved": {"type": "integer"}, "complex_total": {"type": "integer"}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["simple_resolved", "simple_total", "complex_resolved", "complex_total"]}}, "citation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["", "scope-0", "quote-0", "comparison-2", "comparison-1", "rollout-0", "pilot-1", "scope-1", "comparison-0", "quote-2", "scope-2", "quote-1", "rollout-2", "pilot-2", "pilot-0", "workload", "rollout-1"]}, "excerpt": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["simple_resolved", "simple_total", "complex_resolved", "complex_total", "unknown_fields", "citation", "excerpt"], "additionalProperties": false}, "rollout": {"type": "object", "properties": {"stage_days": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "integer"}, "minItems": 1}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["stage_days"]}}, "citation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["", "scope-0", "quote-0", "comparison-2", "comparison-1", "rollout-0", "pilot-1", "scope-1", "comparison-0", "quote-2", "scope-2", "quote-1", "rollout-2", "pilot-2", "pilot-0", "workload", "rollout-1"]}, "excerpt": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["stage_days", "unknown_fields", "citation", "excerpt"], "additionalProperties": false}}}}}}